    "description": "The data is related to tagging of fur seal pups of both beach sexes from\ndifferent beaches on Cape Shirreff, with the purpose of studying the degrees of\nphilopatry, migration and pursuits of the colony through the time, determining\ndifferent population parameters, informing, in addition, the registries of\nprevious seasons, as well as of animals marked in other places. The tagging\nplan has not been able to be developed in all the seasons, although from \n1993/94 it has been carried out uninterrupted.",
